## Criteria and verdicts

{% include 'shared/_criterion_verification_procedure.j2' %}

Use one stable `PA-###` item per criterion in `## Criterion Verdicts`.
Include `Plan-level:` or a step reference, then `Criterion:`, `Expected
observation:`, `Observation:`, `Verdict:`, `Evidence:`, `Location:`,
and `Cost:`. `completed` requires every criterion to be `met` with
evidence and no counterexample found. For `request_changes` or `failed`,
mirror each localized non-met verdict in `## What Came Up Short`; do not add
`How To Fix`. A `not evaluable` criterion requires `failed`.

